{
  "title": "Ziyarat of Hazrat Abdul Muttalib (a.s.)",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "اَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا سَيِّدَ الْكَعْبَةِ وَالْبَطْحَآءِ\nalssalamu `alayka ya sayyida alka`bati walbathha'i\nPeace be upon you, O master of the Ka`bah and al-Bat-ha,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا صَاحِبَ الْمَهَابَةِ وَالْبَهَاءِ\nalssalamu `alayka ya sahiba almahabati walbaha'i\npeace be upon you, O possessor of awe and splendor,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مَعْدِنَ الْكَرَمِ وَ اَصْلَ السَّخَاءِ\nalssalamu `alayka ya ma`dina alkarami wa asla alssakha'i\npeace be upon you, O source of generosity and root of magnanimity,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا اَوَّلَ مَنْ قَالَ بِالْبَدَآءِ\nalssalamu `alayka ya awwala man qala bilbada'i\npeace be upon you, O first to speak of al-Bada' (Allah's revising of decree),\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مَنْ يُّحْشَرُ فِىْ سِيْمَآءِ الْاَنْبِيَآءِ\nalssalamu `alayka ya man yuhsharu fi sima'i al-anbiya'i\npeace be upon you, O one who will be raised bearing the mark of the prophets,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مَعْرُوْفًا فِىْ الْاَرْضِ وَالسَّمَآءِ\nalssalamu `alayka ya ma`rufan fi al-ardi walssama'i\npeace be upon you, O one renowned in the earth and the heaven,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مَنْ نَادَاهُ هَاتِفُ الْغَيْبُ بِاَكْرَمِ نِدَآءِ\nalssalamu `alayka ya man nadahu hatifu alghaybi bi'akrami nida'in\npeace be upon you, O one whom the unseen caller called with the noblest of calls,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَابْنَ اِبْرَاهِيْمَ الْخَلِيْلِ\nalssalamu `alayka yabna ibrahima alkhalili\npeace be upon you, O descendant of Ibrahim, the Intimate Friend of Allah,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ الذَّبِيْحِ اِسْمٰعِيْلَ\nalssalamu `alayka ya waritha aldhdhabihi isma`ila\npeace be upon you, O heir of the sacrificed one, Isma`il,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مَنْ اَهْلَكَ اللهُ بِدُعَائِهِ اَصْحَابَ الْفِيْلَ\nalssalamu `alayka ya man ahlaka allahu bidu`a'ihi ashaba alfili\npeace be upon you, O one by whose supplication Allah destroyed the People of the Elephant,\nوَ جَعَلَ كَيْدَهُمْ فِىْ تَضْلِيْلٍ\nwa ja`ala kaydahum fi tadlilin\nand made their scheming go astray,\nوَ اَرْسَلَ عَلَيْهِمْ طَيْراً اَبَابِيْلَ\nwa arsala `alayhim tayran ababila\nand sent upon them flocks of birds, Ababil.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ يَا سَاقِىَ الْحَجِيْجِ وَ حَافِرَ زَمْزَمَ\nalssalamu ya saqiya alhajiji wa hafira zamzama\nPeace be upon you, O water-giver of the pilgrims and digger of Zamzam,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مَنْ طَافَ حَوْلَ الْكَعْبَةِ وَ جَعَلَ سَبْعَةَ اَشْوَاطٍ\nalssalamu `alayka ya man tafa hawla alka`bati wa ja`ala sab`ata ashwatin\npeace be upon you, O one who circled the Ka`bah, making it seven circuits,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا نُوْرَ الْحَرَمِ وَابْنَ هَاشِمٍ\nalssalamu `alayka ya nura alharami wabna hashimin\npeace be upon you, O light of the Sanctuary and descendant of Hashim,\nوَ صَلَّى اللهُ عَلَيْكَ وَ رَحْمَةُ اللهِ وَ بَرَكَاتُهُ\nwa salla allahu `alayka wa rahmatu allahi wa barakatuhu\nand may Allah send blessings upon you, and Allah’s mercy and blessings."
}
